'''Button''' is an [[NPC]] in the {{Zone|Wizardman Bureau}} in the [[Rift Dimension]].

== Purpose ==
'''Button''' serves as a source of information for how to call {{NPCSprite|Wizardman}} into the {{Zone|Wizardman Bureau}}.

